    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For homologous serial elements across sampled classes, code topology of anatomical connections and test whether order is invariant despite variation in element size and shape. Any well-supported transposition refutes the universal claim.";
